  "question": {
    "text": "Element <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> forms ccp structure and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> occupies half of the octahedral voids, while oxygen atoms occupy all the tetrahedral voids. The structure of bimetallic oxide is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "For ccp structure: <br/>Number of octahedral voids are <math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>  <br/>Number of tetrahedral voids are <math><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math>  <br/><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> (number of atoms present in ccp structure) <br/><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>  <br/><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math>  <br/>So formula is <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo></math>"
  }
